<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — Code-to-model traceability: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module header (L1-L70) maps every law to its source and to the Lean 4 theorem that formalises it, the developmental section is introduced with its own Lean cross-reference (L737) and `pin1_up_the_gradient_transport` names `pin_pairwise_transport_mass_conservation` in its docstring (L781); `morphoeval/math_kg_loops/sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.yaml` registers 5 equations with single-range `code_locus` / `lean_locus` pins re-pointed to the shifted Pass 3 line numbers; self-test comments name the Lean theorem being exercised (L1844, L1861). Deductions: the fixed mode phases (L401, L1024), the 0.18 in-plane contraction factor (L415) and the 6 mm edge-displacement decay (L1033) carry no citation (-3); the ordinal-check thresholds and the half-max primary/secondary split (L933-L940) are documented but not sourced (-2); measurement 12's `reference_source` cites Sharon 2002 Fig. 1c for a serration range that figure does not quantify (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L401–L415: Fixed mode phases and 0.18 in-plane contraction factor in the 3D mesh are unsourced <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L401-L415>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The Pass 2 metric / curvature / wavelength laws (`compute_target_metric_and_curvature`, L151-L195; `compute_local_wavelength_profile`, L197-L211) are faithful to Sharon 2002 / Audoly & Boudaoud 2003 and the new developmental module is a recognisable, honestly-labelled reduction of Nath 2003 / Bilsborough 2011 / Smith-Jönsson 2006: basipetal TCP front (L766-L774), exactly mass-conserving up-the-gradient PIN1 exchange with no-flux ends (L776-L797), CUC2 gating, growth dilution and a growing Lagrangian lattice whose strain ratio gives g_0(y,t) (L805-L1012), with the FvK cascade genuinely re-solved on the developmental <g_0> (L962-L964) and 6 Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) covering Laws 1-5. Deductions: the Pass 2 `relax_foppl_von_karman_cascade` (L230-L367) is a surrogate energy whose target slope s_target (L307), aspect constant 1/sqrt(3) (L283), penetration targets 1.5/r_cascade * lambda_m (L253), cutoff 4.65 t (L280) and hard Gamma < 120 gate (L302) are tuned so the output matches the reference table — wavelength and penetration r = 1.0000 are inputs, not predictions (-4); the gene network is 1D along the margin with no 2D sheet mechanics, no stress feedback on PIN1 polarity and no cell division, and serration outgrowth ds/dt = k_s a (1-m) is kinematic bookkeeping rather than an elastic in-plane growth solution (-2); the Hosta saddle fallback `lmin_s = 39.70` (L592) equals the reference value (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L230–L367: Surrogate L-BFGS-B FvK cascade relaxation: s_target (L307), c_aspect = 1/sqrt(3) (L283), penetration targets (L253), cutoff 4.65 t (L280), Gamma < 120 gate (L302) are prescribed so the output reproduces the reference table <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L230-L367>",
        "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L592–L592: Hard-coded Hosta saddle fallback lmin_s = 39.70 equals the reference value (circular) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L592-L592>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-model-fidelity-4> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

