        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-pass-3-cuc2-pin1-knockout-negative-control-maximum-serration-count-across-both-ablations>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-pass-3-developmental-genotype-ordinal-phenotype-agreement-fraction-6-literature-checks>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-pass-3-developmental-wild-type-excess-metric-g-0-from-coupled-cin-tcp-auxin-cuc2-growth-pdes>,
