<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — Morphological realism / specimen match: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The SHA-256-locked *Lactuca sativa* cv. 'Lollo Bionda' specimen is still segmented via Excess Green (`segment_lactuca_sativa_specimen`, L631-L706; canopy fraction 0.7723; 4 coarse macro-lobes, 19 fine ripples, cascade ratio 4.75 in [3, 5]) and the 4-system aspect-ratio comparison (r_aspect = 0.9992) is unchanged; the new developmental figure adds a 3D coupled FvK surface with in-plane serration outgrowth and a genotype sweep against observed ranges. Deductions: the developmental module is compared with no specimen image at all — its only biological anchor is an ordinal phenotype table transcribed from Arabidopsis papers, applied to a Lactuca margin (-4); the 3D coupled mesh uses fixed mode phases (L401, L1024), an unsourced 0.18 in-plane contraction factor (L415) and an arbitrary 6 mm edge-displacement decay (L1033), and its y-modulation is visibly spiky because g_0(y) follows the auxin peaks (-3); the specimen cascade ratio is a count of perimeter extrema, not a wavelength or amplitude spectrum (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L1014–L1034: Developmental coupled mesh: fixed mode phases (L1024) and arbitrary 6 mm edge-displacement decay (L1033), unsourced <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L1014-L1034>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-specimen-match-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-specimen-match-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-specimen-match-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

